@ [satisfaction_signature_protocol_uuid] ad10f10f-d506-48ef-a805-f8b0a133766c

& [IdentityAccountingWorkspaceP0] is a pure deterministic identity-accounting projection bound to one SharedAttentionFrame
  + [IdentityLedger] stores a complete ordered map of stable AccountableObject records for one declared basket and seals every version with SHA-256
  + [AccountableObject] separates immutable readable handle and type from mutable labels differentiators state roles purposes obligations provenance version and digest
  + [AccountabilityRegister] projects every ledger member in deterministic handle order without truncation
  + [AccountabilityInferenceWindow] binds one validated SharedAttentionFrame digest to one exact ledger and register digest and renders the complete register for inference
  + [ReferenceResolution] resolves exact handles first then normalized labels as resolved ambiguous or unknown without guessing
  + [AccountableObjectPatch] compare-and-set updates one existing record while preserving handle type member count and every unselected record
  + [AttentionReceipt] disposes every register member exactly once and becomes held when any member remains unresolved

  = IAW-01 must: use stable readable handles shaped object:{type}/{local_id}; content hashes are integrity evidence and never the inference-facing name
  = IAW-02 must: allow multiple objects of one type while preserving distinct handle record version state and history-facing digest
  = IAW-03 must: reject duplicate handles malformed handles zero versions empty types and digest mismatch
  = IAW-04 must: preserve handle and type across all P0 mutations
  = IAW-05 must: compile the complete basket roster in deterministic order and fail closed when the complete projection exceeds its byte budget
  = IAW-06 must: bind the inference projection to exact SharedAttentionFrame ledger and register identities
  = IAW-07 must: resolve exact handles deterministically and return every candidate for ambiguous labels
  = IAW-08 must: never use fuzzy similarity to select an effect-bearing identity
  = IAW-09 must: inspect records only through exact existing handles
  = IAW-10 must: apply mutation only when expected ledger digest and object version are current
  = IAW-11 must: conserve the ledger member set and leave all unselected objects byte-for-byte equivalent under one-object mutation
  = IAW-12 must: require one AttentionReceipt disposition per register member with no missing or foreign handles
  = IAW-13 must: classify receipts containing unresolved members as held and complete receipts otherwise
  = IAW-14 must: serialize strict machine forms that deny unknown fields and contain no clock IO model provider database or effect behavior

& [Delineation]
  + [inside] is in-memory typed records deterministic SHA-256 projection exact reference resolution compare-and-set mutation coverage receipts and SharedAttentionFrame binding
  + [boundary] is the caller persists ledgers injects rendered windows invokes inference supplies receipt rationales and authorizes later effects
  + [outside] is fuzzy semantic retrieval hidden model state database durability distributed consensus entity admission removal automatic execution and proof of external truth

& [SatisfactionSignature]
  + [signature_uuid] is 8d2756a5-147a-4d1b-aee6-821529926e9c
